### **mlb_parlay_recommendations_v2** (Parlay headers)

| Column | Type | Notes | Cast Example |
|--------|------|-------|--------------|
| `id` | INTEGER | Serial primary key | No cast needed |
| `run_date` | **DATE** | ⚠️ Actual DATE type (NOT TEXT!) | `run_date >= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL '14 days'` |
| `rank` | INTEGER | Parlay rank (1 = best) | No cast needed |
| `total_odds` | **TEXT** | Contains '1200', '1500', etc. | `total_odds::numeric > 1000` |
| `avg_coverage` | NUMERIC | Average ML score of legs | No cast needed |
| `num_legs` | INTEGER | Number of legs in parlay | No cast needed |
| `outcome` | TEXT | **'won', 'lost', 'void', 'pending'** | No cast needed |
| `source` | TEXT | 'auto_9am', 'auto_12pm', 'auto_530pm', 'manual' | No cast needed |
| `batch_id` | TEXT | | No cast needed |
| `created_at` | TIMESTAMP | | No cast needed |

**Common Query Patterns:**
```sql
-- ✅ CORRECT (run_date is DATE type)
SELECT * FROM mlb_parlay_recommendations_v2
WHERE run_date >= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL '14 days'  -- No ::text cast!
  AND outcome IN ('won', 'lost')
  AND total_odds::numeric > 1000;

-- Join to mlb_scored_legs (DATE → TEXT)
SELECT * FROM mlb_parlay_recommendations_v2 p
JOIN mlb_scored_legs s ON p.run_date::text = s.run_date;

-- ❌ WRONG
SELECT * FROM mlb_parlay_recommendations_v2
WHERE run_date >= (CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL '14 days')::text  -- run_date is DATE, not TEXT
  AND total_odds > 1000;                                      -- total_odds is TEXT
```

