### **mlb_parlay_legs_v2** (Per-leg details)

| Column | Type | Notes | Cast Example |
|--------|------|-------|--------------|
| `id` | INTEGER | Serial primary key | No cast needed |
| `parlay_id` | INTEGER | FK to mlb_parlay_recommendations_v2 | No cast needed |
| `player_name` | TEXT | | No cast needed |
| `team` | TEXT | | No cast needed |
| `stat` | TEXT | | No cast needed |
| `direction` | TEXT | 'over' or 'under' | No cast needed |
| `line` | **TEXT** | Contains numbers | `line::numeric >= 1.5` |
| `odds` | **TEXT** | Contains numbers | `odds::numeric > 100` |
| `coverage` | NUMERIC | ML score for this leg | No cast needed |
| `outcome` | TEXT | **'won', 'lost', 'void', 'pending'** | No cast needed |
| `result_value` | NUMERIC | Actual stat value | No cast needed |
| `position` | INTEGER | Rank within parlay (1 = highest) | No cast needed |
| `created_at` | TIMESTAMP | | `created_at >= NOW() - INTERVAL '14 days'` |

**Common Query Patterns:**
```sql
-- ✅ CORRECT
SELECT * FROM mlb_parlay_legs_v2
WHERE created_at >= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL '14 days'
  AND outcome IN ('won', 'lost')
  AND odds::numeric > 100;

-- Join to mlb_scored_legs (TIMESTAMP → TEXT)
SELECT * FROM mlb_parlay_legs_v2 l
JOIN mlb_scored_legs s 
  ON l.player_name = s.player_name
  AND l.stat = s.stat
  AND l.direction = s.direction
  AND l.created_at::date::text = s.run_date;  -- TIMESTAMP → DATE → TEXT

-- ❌ WRONG
SELECT * FROM mlb_parlay_legs_v2 l
JOIN mlb_scored_legs s ON DATE(l.created_at) = s.run_date;  -- Missing ::text
```

