## Join Pattern Cheat Sheet

### **Parlay Legs → Scored Legs**
```sql
FROM mlb_parlay_legs_v2 l
JOIN mlb_scored_legs s 
  ON l.player_name = s.player_name
  AND l.stat = s.stat
  AND l.direction = s.direction
  AND l.created_at::date::text = s.run_date  -- ✅ CORRECT
```

### **Parlay Headers → Scored Legs**
```sql
FROM mlb_parlay_recommendations_v2 p
JOIN mlb_scored_legs s ON p.run_date::text = s.run_date  -- ✅ CORRECT
```

### **Parlay Headers → Parlay Legs**
```sql
FROM mlb_parlay_recommendations_v2 p
JOIN mlb_parlay_legs_v2 l ON l.parlay_id = p.id  -- ✅ No cast needed
```

