## Common Errors & Fixes

### Error: `operator does not exist: text >= date`
```sql
-- ❌ WRONG
WHERE run_date >= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL '14 days'

-- ✅ CORRECT (for TEXT columns)
WHERE run_date >= (CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL '14 days')::text
```

### Error: `operator does not exist: date >= text`
```sql
-- ❌ WRONG (for DATE columns like mlb_parlay_recommendations_v2.run_date)
WHERE run_date >= (CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL '14 days')::text

-- ✅ CORRECT
WHERE run_date >= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL '14 days'
```

### Error: `function avg(text) does not exist`
```sql
-- ❌ WRONG
SELECT AVG(odds) FROM mlb_scored_legs

-- ✅ CORRECT
SELECT AVG(odds::numeric) FROM mlb_scored_legs
```

### Error: `operator does not exist: text = date`
```sql
-- ❌ WRONG
WHERE p.run_date = s.run_date  -- p.run_date is DATE, s.run_date is TEXT

-- ✅ CORRECT
WHERE p.run_date::text = s.run_date
```

